[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11881.83, "timestamp": "03:18:01", "text": "听起来像是伪装。好的，我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11884.389, "timestamp": "03:18:04", "text": "短暂伪装一下。女王，你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11886.63, "timestamp": "03:18:06", "text": "处理他。听着，我得处理……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11888.87, "timestamp": "03:18:08", "text": "部分顾客。给我一次信号就好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11892.469, "timestamp": "03:18:12", "text": "你拿到车了。我的天哪。资金塔"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11906.19, "timestamp": "03:18:26", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11909.15, "timestamp": "03:18:29", "text": "为了？这些东西很酷。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11912.63, "timestamp": "03:18:32", "text": "这似乎是获取更多战利品的一种方式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11916.389, "timestamp": "03:18:36", "text": "或者别的什么。或者它是否存在于旧物中？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11928.55, "timestamp": "03:18:48", "text": "我好像没见过这种类型的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11930.51, "timestamp": "03:18:50", "text": "主要机械"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11933.269, "timestamp": "03:18:53", "text": "战役模式中的游戏。不是主游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11935.229, "timestamp": "03:18:55", "text": "好的。活动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11938.51, "timestamp": "03:18:58", "text": "活动。卓越"}]